            <ArticleTitle>Crystal structure and features of 3',8-di-benzyl-idene-4a,5,6,7,8,8a-hexa-hydro-2'H-spiro-[chromene-2,1'-cyclo-hexa-n]-2'-one.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
